{"version": 1, "sourceSha256": "fc1c1372caee53acf5271b79d92936d4b768b02606ed8e0c8771b8c80c390d5a", "documents": [{"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}, {"id": "genododi-test-dfce35bdbfe2254a", "filename": "PART B.m4a", "sha256": "fc1c1372caee53acf5271b79d92936d4b768b02606ed8e0c8771b8c80c390d5a", "assetPath": "supplied-materials/files/fc1c1372caee53acf5271b79d92936d4b768b02606ed8e0c8771b8c80c390d5a.m4a", "textPath": "supplied-materials/text/fc1c1372caee53acf5271b79d92936d4b768b02606ed8e0c8771b8c80c390d5a.json", "format": "m4a", "role": "recording"}], "units": [{"id": "jahshan-1Eq0Wd728xzkK6TPTPyDC2b5k8xPPBUlj-B-0-recording-fc1c1372caee", "label": "Jahshan set 17 · Part B", "part": "B", "sourceSha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "pages": [193, 194], "questions": [{"number": 1, "prompt": "What does the patient suggest about their pain?\nSelect one:\nA. it affects his breathing.\nB. it is located mainly in his chest.\nC. it makes it difficult for him to go walking.", "sourcePage": 193, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 198, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 2, "prompt": "You hear a senior nurse talking about removing sutures to a group\nof students.\nWhat is she doing?\nSelect one:\nA. Recommending a clear procedure to follow.\nB. Explaining why a clean environment is important.\nC. Suggesting that sometimes there may be complications.", "sourcePage": 193, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 198, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "You hear a staff nurse talking to a patient she is escorting to the\nRadiology Department.\nWhat does she need to know from the patient?\nSelect one:\nA. If he is ready.\nB. How he is feeling.\nC. His personal details.", "sourcePage": 193, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 198, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "You hear a nurse talking with a patient in the recovery unit.\nWhat is the patient worried about?\nSelect one:\nA. Her breathing difficulties.\nB. The pain in her chest.\nC. How cold she feels.", "sourcePage": 194, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 198, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "You hear the beginning of a training session for doctors.\nThe trainer explains that the session will focus on\nSelect one:\nA. how hormones work.\nB. the purpose of various glands.\nC. problems with the endocrine system.", "sourcePage": 194, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 198, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "You hear a doctor talking to a nurse about a patient called Mr\nKransky.\nThe doctor wants the nurse to\nSelect one:\nA. ensure the patient can feed themselves by the end of the week.\nB. contact the OT about the patient’s swallowing reflex.\nC. continue the patient on their current diet.", "sourcePage": 194, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 198, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["fc1c1372caee53acf5271b79d92936d4b768b02606ed8e0c8771b8c80c390d5a"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Matching sound verified in three separated windows; excerpt questions restricted to the spoken question range", "referenceRecordingSha256": "6a5a4dbdf23d00c8147081172adf3176eec440012f03595dd486c153e0e6e35f"}]}
